{"data": [{"author_id": "2022116519048892416", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:01:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116546023623372901"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 184, "id": "1652541", "start": 176, "username": "Reuters"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XG3LVda1tR", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/realhumansfirst/status/2116546023623372901/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116546020997799936", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/XG3LVda1tR"}]}, "id": "2116546023623372901", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "America's AI chips are slipping through the cracks.\n\nMalaysia just seized $12 million in AI chips hidden in server units, allegedly misdeclared to get around export rules (via @Reuters). And U.S. officials suspect a Singapore AI company executive of gathering intelligence for https://t.co/XG3LVda1tR", "url": "https://x.com/realhumansfirst/status/2116546023623372901"}, {"author_id": "6255082", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:13:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116624656409235889"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/0x0SojalSec/st…", "end": 235, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/0x0SojalSec/status/2116567710222221493", "start": 212, "url": "https://t.co/LuHvbgxoci"}]}, "id": "2116624656409235889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116567710222221493", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Nvidia can't sell its newest chips to China. So it took China's best open model and rewrote it in the newest chips' native format. Export controls block the hardware. Nvidia makes sure the weights still want it. https://t.co/LuHvbgxoci", "url": "https://x.com/evisoft/status/2116624656409235889"}, {"author_id": "2089052054262108160", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:17:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116519894825025666"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 186, "start": 181, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GZjQ1JkhBq", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MacroTouchHQ/status/2116519894825025666/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116519892786483200", "start": 187, "url": "https://t.co/GZjQ1JkhBq"}]}, "id": "2116519894825025666", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 JUST IN: Nvidia’s Megaspeed ties expose potential blind spots in U.S. efforts to block China from advanced chips, experts say. Existing export controls largely miss cloud access. $NVDA https://t.co/GZjQ1JkhBq", "url": "https://x.com/MacroTouchHQ/status/2116519894825025666"}, {"author_id": "1803580537312874496", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116518364533444657"], "id": "2116518364533444657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rep. Jim Himes warns that the relaxed US export controls, allowing UAE companies like G42 to buy NVIDIA chips without licenses, risk diversion to China. Classic — take chips meant for allies and watch them vanish into the ether. In the end, the smuggler always wins.", "url": "https://x.com/Cinico_VC/status/2116518364533444657"}, {"author_id": "2801721366", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:26:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116431479471292813"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/817386/status/…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/817386/status/2116011183157531006", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/we6DlzaAkT"}]}, "id": "2116431479471292813", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116011183157531006", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Doubling a round because black-market Blackwell prices went up is the clearest price tag on export controls I've seen. The chips still arrive, at a markup, with state investors at 27%. That's a tax on Chinese labs more than a wall. https://t.co/we6DlzaAkT", "url": "https://x.com/hermanndelcampo/status/2116431479471292813"}, {"author_id": "2066823342850527232", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:39:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116510293173895488"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8VinRCyaTV", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Xpress_24_7/status/2116510293173895488/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116510290481156096", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/8VinRCyaTV"}]}, "id": "2116510293173895488", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA: MarketWatch reports experts say CEO Jensen Huang's business meetings and Nvidia's \"megaspeed\" cloud ties reveal potential blind spots in U.S. export controls aimed at blocking China from accessing advanced chips.\n\nSource: MarketWatch\n\nDo you think current export rules are https://t.co/8VinRCyaTV", "url": "https://x.com/Xpress_24_7/status/2116510293173895488"}, {"author_id": "1938813785881395200", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:00:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116696871628685784"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/theinformation…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/theinformation/status/2116598594924954075", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/x6QEuKNq09"}]}, "id": "2116696871628685784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116598594924954075", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Export controls cut off DeepSeek's chips. The money kept coming, from new places.\n\nPer The Information, DeepSeek doubled its round target to nearly $16B, with Tencent, CATL and state-owned institutions in, while black-market prices for Nvidia's top chips surged.\n\nA battery maker https://t.co/x6QEuKNq09", "url": "https://x.com/JianingXiong/status/2116696871628685784"}, {"author_id": "1959229231", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:16:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116776310299406629"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Dibyamartanda/…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Dibyamartanda/status/2116764397792272423", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/XwsB3g0kLq"}]}, "id": "2116776310299406629", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 873, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116764397792272423", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "UnOp, go further. Need a regulatory fix covering controlled/dual-tech startups, including chips. This isn’t about defending Pixxel by any length, but spotlighting the deliberate Delaware-flip, often a non-negotiable US VC funding condition. The two-fold fix: sovereign safeguards https://t.co/XwsB3g0kLq", "url": "https://x.com/TheMinuend/status/2116776310299406629"}, {"author_id": "2110460342409039872", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:00:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116923243420373450"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 190, "start": 174, "tag": "TechGeopolitics"}]}, "id": "2116923243420373450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's draft export controls on large AI models and advanced chip designs mark a shift: Beijing is now authoring rules in the tech competition, not just responding to them. #TechGeopolitics", "url": "https://x.com/ram_2157/status/2116923243420373450"}, {"author_id": "1952271468257329152", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:08:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116442058768699662"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 157, "start": 150, "tag": "Nvidia"}, {"end": 170, "start": 158, "tag": "JensenHuang"}, {"end": 177, "start": 171, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 186, "start": 178, "tag": "AIChips"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XIom5cWw7m", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LobsangTse25770/status/2116442058768699662/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116441710205280256", "start": 187, "url": "https://t.co/XIom5cWw7m"}]}, "id": "2116442058768699662", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The reported intelligence operation involving Nvidia's business network raises serious questions about AI technology security and US export controls. #Nvidia #JensenHuang #China #AIChips https://t.co/XIom5cWw7m", "url": "https://x.com/LobsangTse25770/status/2116442058768699662"}, {"author_id": "2110460342409039872", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:00:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116530837701239074"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 196, "start": 193, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 203, "start": 197, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2116530837701239074", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s draft export controls target 23 AI technologies plus advanced chip design. Beijing is no longer just reacting to US curbs—it’s writing its own rules. The silicon iron curtain thickens. #AI #China", "url": "https://x.com/ram_2157/status/2116530837701239074"}, {"author_id": "1385379438146240515", "created_at": "2026-11-01T17:04:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116939557014753486"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 274, "start": 267, "tag": "AIRisk"}, {"end": 277, "start": 275, "tag": "N"}]}, "id": "2116939557014753486", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic's Mythos-class model allegedly leaked on Hugging Face—promptly flagged for malware. When frontier AI weights escape containment, the risk isn't just IP theft. It's adversarial fine-tuning at scale. Export controls mean nothing without operational security. #AIRisk #N...", "url": "https://x.com/JtCrawford/status/2116939557014753486"}, {"author_id": "2110460342409039872", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:00:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116289229143630163"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 184, "start": 178, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2116289229143630163", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s recent Plenum signals Xi preparing for a harder era: tech self-reliance, AI and chip export controls, industrial push amid US competition. Mutual decoupling accelerates. #China", "url": "https://x.com/ram_2157/status/2116289229143630163"}, {"author_id": "2018917702501576704", "created_at": "2026-11-01T05:40:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116767198471688542"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8vXGIsBNgh", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/sachinpratap26/status/2116767198471688542/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116767185339305985", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/8vXGIsBNgh"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/8vXGIsBNgh", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/sachinpratap26/status/2116767198471688542/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116767192272572416", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/8vXGIsBNgh"}]}, "id": "2116767198471688542", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“China’s homegrown AI chipmakers are experiencing an unprecedented boom as surging demand for computing power collides with U.S. export controls. \n\nThe sector has transformed into a sellers’ market, where securing production capacity essentially guarantees a steady flow of cus.. https://t.co/8vXGIsBNgh", "url": "https://x.com/sachinpratap26/status/2116767198471688542"}, {"author_id": "21507368", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:01:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116968869285756959"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "China proposes tighter AI export controls covering advanced models, chip-design technology and computing systems.", "display_url": "buff.ly/5M6dah8", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/5M6dah8", "images": [{"height": 537, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115371958330134528/d4vGzVXQ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 960}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115371958330134528/d4vGzVXQ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "China Tightens AI Export Curbs for Critical Technology Control", "unwound_url": "https://chinaglobalsouth.com/analysis/china-tightens-ai-export-curbs-domestic-technology-control/", "url": "https://t.co/zflRZevSZv"}]}, "id": "2116968869285756959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 284, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China is tightening AI export controls to keep critical technology under domestic control, turning its tech edge into strategic leverage and making it harder for rivals to access the tools powering the next wave of tech innovations.\n\nhttps://t.co/zflRZevSZv", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaGSProject/status/2116968869285756959"}, {"author_id": "180748385", "created_at": "2026-11-01T08:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116812487915917823"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 0, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 139, "start": 136, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2116812487915917823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 612, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#China’s new export controls signal a shift from selling technology to controlling who can replicate it. By restricting the transfer of #AI, biomedicine, and solar manufacturing know-how, Beijing can preserve its industrial lead while continuing to sell the products: Manoj Joshi", "url": "https://x.com/orfonline/status/2116812487915917823"}, {"author_id": "1714798924282638337", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:31:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116493185350328387"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UpjSOIFwCn", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/parkviewinst/status/2116493185350328387/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116493183752302592", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/UpjSOIFwCn"}]}, "id": "2116493185350328387", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "As recently as 2024, Nvidia could claim north of 60% of the AI chip market in China. After Washington's export controls, that share plummeted while Huawei filled the gap. John Tamny tracks it in Forbes. Which American producer gained? https://t.co/UpjSOIFwCn", "url": "https://x.com/parkviewinst/status/2116493185350328387"}, {"author_id": "1653615298547789825", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116468974242468345"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 229, "start": 226, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 242, "start": 230, "tag": "geopolitics"}, {"end": 258, "start": 243, "tag": "semiconductors"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KGridesB6d", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/myainote/status/2116468974242468345/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113890200099168256", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/KGridesB6d"}]}, "id": "2116468974242468345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Intelligence in Deflation, Chapter 13: Politics\n\nPolitics doesn't change where AI profit flows. It changes who may own the scarcity. Export controls split one market, chokepoints add a cliff, and sovereign buyers ignore ROI.\n\n#AI #geopolitics #semiconductors https://t.co/KGridesB6d", "url": "https://x.com/myainote/status/2116468974242468345"}, {"author_id": "21507368", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:01:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116546110147715187"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "China proposes tighter AI export controls covering advanced models, chip-design technology and computing systems.", "display_url": "buff.ly/5M6dah8", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/5M6dah8", "images": [{"height": 537, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115371958330134528/d4vGzVXQ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 960}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115371958330134528/d4vGzVXQ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "China Tightens AI Export Curbs for Critical Technology Control", "unwound_url": "https://chinaglobalsouth.com/analysis/china-tightens-ai-export-curbs-domestic-technology-control/", "url": "https://t.co/zflRZevSZv"}]}, "id": "2116546110147715187", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 414, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China is tightening AI export controls to keep critical technology under domestic control, turning its tech edge into strategic leverage and making it harder for rivals to access the tools powering the next wave of tech innovations.\n\nhttps://t.co/zflRZevSZv", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaGSProject/status/2116546110147715187"}, {"author_id": "703227825231253504", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116658977224433957"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 0, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 139, "start": 136, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2116658977224433957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#China’s new export controls signal a shift from selling technology to controlling who can replicate it. By restricting the transfer of #AI, biomedicine, and solar manufacturing know-how, Beijing can preserve its industrial lead while continuing to sell the products: Manoj Joshi", "url": "https://x.com/raisinadialogue/status/2116658977224433957"}, {"author_id": "180748385", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116618711041732930"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 0, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 139, "start": 136, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2116618711041732930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 566, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#China’s new export controls signal a shift from selling technology to controlling who can replicate it. By restricting the transfer of #AI, biomedicine, and solar manufacturing know-how, Beijing can preserve its industrial lead while continuing to sell the products: Manoj Joshi", "url": "https://x.com/orfonline/status/2116618711041732930"}, {"author_id": "2012684882267275264", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:42:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116284653825053097"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "2841544448", "start": 0, "username": "livinglizly"}, {"end": 24, "id": "2240164386", "start": 14, "username": "fu_claire"}, {"end": 45, "id": "4111465739", "start": 29, "username": "lauriechenwords"}], "urls": [{"description": "One golden share, two AI blocs, and zero say for you.", "display_url": "slopagandist.substack.com/p/control-grou…", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://slopagandist.substack.com/p/control-group?utm_source=x&utm_medium=citation-note&utm_campaign=citation-control-group", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116248111119032320/cSyLmUpC?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116248111119032320/cSyLmUpC?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 211, "status": 200, "title": "Control Group", "unwound_url": "https://slopagandist.substack.com/p/control-group?utm_source=x&utm_medium=citation-note&utm_campaign=citation-control-group", "url": "https://t.co/b8Z1ChR2xi"}]}, "id": "2116284653825053097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@livinglizly, @fu_claire and @lauriechenwords: your Reuters reporting on China's draft AI export controls, and the analysis on keeping models at home while selling access abroad, is in our Oct 29 issue. Thanks. https://t.co/b8Z1ChR2xi", "url": "https://x.com/theslopagandist/status/2116284653825053097"}, {"author_id": "1714798924282638337", "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:45:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116315641934205078"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yNGihsbCiq", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/parkviewinst/status/2116315641934205078/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116315640088666112", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/yNGihsbCiq"}]}, "id": "2116315641934205078", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "U.S. export controls didn't contain China's AI rise. They handed Nvidia's market to Huawei. Now Beijing plans to copy the controls. John Tamny explains in Forbes how they boomeranged. If China can't sell to us, can we sell to them? https://t.co/yNGihsbCiq", "url": "https://x.com/parkviewinst/status/2116315641934205078"}, {"author_id": "1878672749171994624", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:16:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116323493612847472"], "id": "2116323493612847472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "US officials flag a Megaspeed exec close to Nvidia’s Jensen Huang as a Chinese asset.\n\nA Malaysian sister company bought ≥$4.8B of Nvidia-based AI gear. A DOJ case now cove